   "level": 2,
   "text": "Geothermal energy"
  },
  {
   "type": "bullets",
   "md": "- **Tectonic activity** causes areas where the rocks below ground become **heated**\n- Energy in the thermal store of the rocks can be obtained by:\n\n  - Drilling **shafts **into the Earth's surface to expose the heated rocks\n  - Injecting **water **into the shaft which is heated by the rocks\n  - The water is returned via another shaft as **steam **or hot water\n  - The steam can be used to turn a **turbine **and generate electricity\n  - The hot water can be used to heat homes and provide a **hot water** supply to households"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 4,
   "text": "Geothermal power station"
  },
